SonicForge
==========

SonicForge is an independent, from-scratch implementation of a system-wide audio
processor for Windows. It is not a fork of Equalizer APO and contains no Equalizer APO
source code.

Equalizer APO
-------------

The configuration file format and the user-visible behaviour that SonicForge reimplements
were derived from the publicly documented Equalizer APO configuration reference and from
observing the released application.

