public domain reference material.

Third-party Rust crates
-----------------------

SonicForge uses the following crates; their licences are compatible with GPL-2.0-or-later:

  * egui / eframe — MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * windows / windows-sys — MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * serde, serde_json — MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * regex — MIT OR Apache-2.0
  * tempfile (tests only) — MIT OR Apache-2.0

See `Cargo.lock` for the exact dependency set of a build.
